# No M-Dashes in Replies

Never use em dashes (`—`) or en dashes (`–`) as m-dashes in replies.

Use commas, periods, or hyphens (`-`) instead.

proteinquest.app `<title>` and `og:title` must use a vertical bar: `ProteinQuest | Hit your protein. Actually stick with it.` Never rewrite that `|` to an em dash.

Examples:
- Bad: "Ship it — then test."
- Good: "Ship it, then test."
- Good: "Ship it. Then test."
- Good: "Ship it - then test."
